---
import PolicyPage from "../components/PolicyPage.astro";
import { pageSeo } from "../seo/registry.mjs";
---

<PolicyPage
	title="Course Policy – 3Back"
	description="Course policies for 3Back On-Demand, In-Person, and Live Online Public Courses."
	metadata={pageSeo["/policies"]}
>
	<p>At 3Back, we offer flexible learning options, including On-Demand, In-Person, and Live Online Public Courses. Please review our course policies below:</p>

	<h2>On-Demand Advanced and CSP Course Policy</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Refunds:</strong> You are eligible for a full refund if you cancel within seven days of purchase, provided the course has not been started. Once the course begins, it is non-refundable.</li>
		<li><strong>Course Completion Window:</strong> You have three months from the date of purchase to complete the course.</li>
		<li><strong>Extension:</strong> If needed, you can extend the completion window by three months for a $125 fee.</li>
		<li><strong>Non-transferable:</strong> Once started, courses cannot be transferred to another individual.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>In-Person and Live Online Public Course Policy</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Cancellations:</strong> You may cancel for a full refund up to seven business days before the course start date. If you cancel within seven business days of the course, a $99 cancellation fee will apply.</li>
		<li><strong>Rescheduling:</strong> Life happens! We are happy to reschedule your course to another 3Back event. However, rescheduling within two business days of the course will incur a $99 fee. If you reschedule more than once, each additional reschedule will also incur a $99 fee.</li>
		<li><strong>No Shows and Partial Attendance:</strong> No refunds or credits are provided if you fail to attend or complete the course.</li>
		<li><strong>Substitutions:</strong> You may substitute another team member or colleague at any time before the course begins.</li>
		<li><strong>Retakes:</strong> We offer two complimentary seats per live online public course for students who have already completed the same course. This offer is on a first-come, first-served basis and applies only within six months of your original course completion.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>In-Person Course Specific Policies</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Rescheduling:</strong> If you need to reschedule within seven business days of the course, there is a $150 fee. Rescheduling more than once will also incur a $150 fee for each instance.</li>
		<li><strong>Cancellations:</strong> Full refunds are available if you cancel at least 14 business days before the course start date. Cancellations made within 14 business days will incur a $150 fee.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Foundational Courses Policy</h2>
	<p>All foundational courses, such as CSM and CSPO, require a minimum of 14 hours of student-instructor contact for virtual classes, which must be completed within the scheduled dates.</p>
	<p>For cancellations or rescheduling, please contact our Finance Department at 855-32-3BACK (855-323-2225) or email us at <a href="mailto:info@3Back.com">info@3Back.com</a>.</p>

	<hr />

	<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
	<p>For further details on our privacy policy, please visit our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> page.</p>
</PolicyPage>
